### Check first
Open [{{causeComponentName}}](/#/components/{{causeComponentUrnForUrl}}/highlights), the dependency contributing health to **{{componentName}}**, and inspect its failing checks and [metrics](/#/components/{{causeComponentUrnForUrl}}/metrics).

### Likely causes
The hosting service or an underlying runtime dependency is unhealthy. This is inherited health, not evidence that the agent implementation itself is invalid.

### Fix
Resolve the contributing dependency's reported failure. Follow its own monitor guidance before changing the agent or restarting its hosting service.

### Verify
Confirm the dependency recovers and the agent's derived health updates. If dependency health is absent, inspect service discovery and monitoring; missing observations cannot establish healthy operation. Served models have separate checks based on their own product telemetry.
